      "message": "test(app): fig8 Outside full-width reading moves to the one ring set\n\nOutside now walks the offsets of the part. At the fig8 waist the rings\nof the two lobes merge and 495 points take the full tool width, all in\nthe waist band (Inside on the same set reads 10686). The pin holds the\nrest of the band at none; #3788 cuts the merge.\n\nRefs #3744\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
