      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/3744-one-ring-set\n\nConflict in pocket_avoid.rs: main moved the per-level plan into\npocket_avoid_level.rs (plan_avoid_level). The ring_side::resolve call\nmoves there, and cleared_links reads ring_side::resolves. Also: the\nfig8 crossing pin fig8_start_sides_have_no_crossing (Inside and\nOutside), and the snap reading in the right unit (3 nm, not 3 um).\n\nRefs #3744\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
