      },
      "message": "fix(2d): name each full-width cut of a start-side plan by the flanks law\n\norder() now judges a full-width cut by the law of the full-width meter:\nboth flank points, 0.9 tool radii either side of the walk, stand in\nuncut material. The fig8 waist cuts of the one ring set (Outside 495\nmeter points, 14 cuts) are named on the path now; before, the narrow\nnote said nothing. Inside names its waist cuts the same way.\n\nRefs #3744\nRefs #3788\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
